00:39:54.311 --> 00:39:56.094
<font color="#FFFF00">Ok.</font>

00:39:59.631 --> 00:40:00.849
<font color="#FFFF00">Kau benar-benar teman kencan yang tangguh.</font>

00:40:03.402 --> 00:40:06.154
<font color="#FFFF00">Kau sudah bilang pada Jane
bahwa kau belum pergi?</font>

00:40:06.156 --> 00:40:07.205
<font color="#FFFF00">Tidak. Tidak. Belum</font>

00:40:07.207 --> 00:40:09.974
<font color="#FFFF00">Oh.
Dia akan mengerti.</font>

00:40:09.976 --> 00:40:12.077
<font color="#FFFF00">Yeah.</font>

00:40:12.079 --> 00:40:14.362
<font color="#FFFF00">All right.</font>

00:40:14.364 --> 00:40:17.115
<font color="#FFFF00">Aku mau turun.
Baiklah.</font>

00:40:36.168 --> 00:40:37.469
<font color="#FFFF00">Bagaimana dengan Abbott?</font>

00:40:37.471 --> 00:40:39.387
<font color="#FFFF00">Eh.</font>

00:40:41.941 --> 00:40:43.141
<font color="#FFFF00">Terima kasih.</font>

00:40:47.296 --> 00:40:49.481
<font color="#FFFF00">Terkadang kita ini tim yang bagus</font>

00:40:50.399 --> 00:40:53.067
<font color="#FFFF00">Yeah. Memang.</font>

00:40:54.954 --> 00:40:57.188
<font color="#FFFF00">Kau akan pergi?</font>

00:40:57.190 --> 00:40:58.406
<font color="#FFFF00">Yeah.</font>

00:40:58.408 --> 00:41:01.025
<font color="#FFFF00">Sampai jumpa besok?</font>

00:41:01.027 --> 00:41:02.360
<font color="#FFFF00">Aku masih akan disini.</font>

00:41:08.134 --> 00:41:10.985
<font color="#FFFF00">Selamat malam.</font>

00:41:11.010 --> 00:41:16.010
